<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Cyqlone</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Fast,<sp/>**parallel<sp/>and<sp/>vectorized<sp/>solver**<sp/>for<sp/>linear<sp/>systems<sp/>with<sp/>**optimal<sp/>control<sp/>structure**.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Also<sp/>includes<sp/>an<sp/>implementation<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>**CyQPALM**<sp/>solver<sp/>that<sp/>uses<sp/>the<sp/>Cyqlone<sp/>linear<sp/>solver<sp/>as<sp/>a</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">backend,<sp/>with<sp/>parallel<sp/>factorization<sp/>update<sp/>routines<sp/>to<sp/>handle<sp/>active<sp/>set<sp/>changes<sp/>and<sp/>a<sp/>parallel</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">exact<sp/>line<sp/>search.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
